do_2       = "Prove that each chosen name answers eth_chainId 0x7d through its hop with the Host header the boundary sends; where a node's nginx refuses that Host, add the loopback address to the server_name of that node's apiN vhost, check nginx -t and reload it."
do_3       = "Add the paxeer-boundary subcommand: both instances answer eth_chainId 0x7d over TLS under the internal CA inside the kernel machine, their hops name two different serving RPC names, and each answers eth_blockNumber within ten blocks of the highest public answer."
